{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13101260","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13101260","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1310126001:0":{"text":"...듀라의 이름으로... 이 땅을 살피시고, 저희가 악에서 벗어날 수 있기를...","source_cn":"……艾雅在上，尊您神名……愿您注视着大地，救我们脱离凶恶……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CC82583D82F8A20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1310126002:0":{"text":"기도하는 걸 보니 아무렇지도 않은가 본데! 아주 괜찮은 젊은이야, 용감해!","source_cn":"嚯，还记得祈祷，看来你没什么事啊！小伙子不错，胆子很大！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89BF776401EC30CA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1310126003:0":{"text":"사실... 전 무척이나 겁이 나요... 듀라 님께 기도를 올리는 건... 용기를 얻기 위해서예요...","source_cn":"我……其实我害怕得很……想着向艾雅祈祷……壮壮胆……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7560B1E4282D627A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1310126004:1":{"text":"게다가 하얀 늑대가 살아있는 시체를 뒤쫓아 갔으니... 그렇게 무서워할 필요는 없는데...","source_cn":"而且，白狼兄弟去追击活死人了，我……我也不用太害怕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x860E1D74C0D1B7AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1310126004":{"text":"게다가 하얀 늑대가 살아있는 시체를 뒤쫓아 갔으니... 그렇게 무서워할 필요는 없는데...","source_cn":"而且，白狼兄弟去追击活死人了，我……我也不用太害怕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x860E1D74C0D1B7AE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1310126005:0":{"text":"네, 탈출한지 얼마 되지 않아 그가 몬스터 몇 마리를 뒤쫓아 가는 걸 보았어요. <style=\"highlight\">길을 따라 북쪽</style>으로 가더라고요.","source_cn":"嗯，我们逃出来没多久，我看到他追着几个怪物，<styl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60CCF08AC5796EAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1310126006:0":{"text":"다행이네요, 그를 도우러 가요!","source_cn":"太好了，我们去帮他！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F424E80A4AFCCA6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1310126007:0":{"text":"밖에서 서 계시지 말고, 우선 팔라모르 씨의 오두막으로 피하세요!","source_cn":"你也别在外面站着了，先去法拉莫尔的小屋躲躲吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFEF4D7B947669A1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"팔라모르를 봤어?","source_cn":"你看到了法拉莫尔？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7A71E991257755CC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"팔라모르를 봤어?","female":"팔라모르를 봤어?","variant_male_record_index":"68622","variant_female_record_index":"68623","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:商人斯瓦夫":{"text":"상인 스와프","source":"商人斯瓦夫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:呼金":{"text":"후긴","source":"呼金","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","